    "body": "- Build out the \"Overlays\" section: Modal (showcase/playground), AlertDialog,\nDrawer, Sheet, Popover, DropdownMenu, ContextMenu, and CommandMenu, each\nwith a full React component, Web Component registration, showcase, and\ninteractive Playground.\n- Add a global Plain JS/TS, React, Vue, and Angular selector (Header\ndropdown, persisted via CodeFrameworkProvider) that drives every code\nexample on the site at once. CodeBlock and PlaygroundLayout/CodeBar now\ntake a `variants` map instead of a single `code` string, with an honest\nfallback note when a framework-specific example isn't available.\n- Populate js/vue/angular variants across all showcase and Playground code\nexamples, using the real registered Web Component props/events, with\ncorrect handling for JSON-typed props, native vs. bridged events, and\nr2wc's boolean-attribute parsing quirk.\n- Normalize every generated example to self-closing tags and PascalCase\ncomponent names (matching the React example) across all four languages.\n- Clean up the sidebar menu: remove duplicate/redundant entries (Tooltip,\nPagination, Breadcrumbs, Table, Avatar, Progress, Skeleton, Confirmation)\nand consolidate each into its single best-fit category."
